# Data Deletion

facet app

Effective date: July 4, 2026

You can ask us to delete the data associated with your Workbooks account and any accounts you have
connected (including data we accessed from Meta Platforms — Facebook, Instagram, and WhatsApp Business),
at any time. This page explains how.

## How to request deletion

Email [shane@shinyobjectz.com](mailto:shane@shinyobjectz.com) from the address on your account with the
subject line **"Delete my data"**, or use the in-app control at **Settings → Account → Delete my data**.
Please include your account email so we can locate your records. If you are requesting deletion of data
tied to a specific connected platform (for example a Facebook or Instagram account), tell us which one.

## What we delete

Upon a verified request we delete: your account and profile information; the workbooks, documents, and
content you created; and the access tokens and any cached data obtained from connected platforms. Some
information may be retained where a longer period is required by law (for example, financial records) or
in secure backups that are overwritten on a rolling basis.

## Timeframe

We confirm receipt within 5 business days and complete deletion within 30 days. We will email you when
the deletion is complete.

## Disconnecting a single platform

To revoke our access to a connected platform without deleting your whole account, open **Settings →
Connections** and disconnect that platform. This immediately revokes our access to that platform's data
going forward. You can also remove Workbooks from the platform's own app settings (for example, Facebook
Settings → Apps and Websites).

